    "detailed_description": "<strong>PiAwk - A game about freedom.</strong><br><br>Explore a beautiful, symbolic and mysterious universe. Discover the astounding secrets that binds you to it.<br><br>PiAwk is a little bird-like creature.. somewhat awkward and shy, but bold and curious who loves to dream and explore there.<br>You will have to venture on a journey to find a way out of the ruined world in which it has been enclosed.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br>\u2022 Unique visual style.<br>\u2022 Non-linear adventure gameplay.<br>\u2022 A lot of secrets to discover.<br>\u2022 Little world physics.<br>\u2022 Play like a bird.<br>\u2022 An original story about freedom.<br>\u2022 Fun and challenging interactions.<br>\u2022 A relaxing but exciting experience.<br>\u2022 Designed for one player.<br><br><br>Developed by a solo dev who has pampered every detail to create a very personal and unique game.",
